<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-font name="Inter" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:ital,opsz,wght@0,14..32,100..900;1,14..32,100..900&display=swap"></mj-font>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="'Inter',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"></mj-all>

      <mj-text font-weight="400" font-size="18px" line-height="24px"></mj-text>
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style> td {font-size:18px; line-height:24px} </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#000">
    <mj-section background-color="#000" padding="10px">
      <mj-column>

        <mj-image padding="0px" width="100px" src="https://images.ampscriptacademy.com.au/uploads/image-removebg-preview.png"></mj-image>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-hero mode="fixed-height" height="300px" background-width="600px" background-height="300px" background-url="%%=v(@heroBanner)=%%" background-color="#000" padding="100px 0px">

      <mj-text padding="20px" color="#ffffff" align="left" font-size="45px" line-height="45px" font-weight="900">
        <p>%%=v(@hero_text)=%%</p>
      </mj-text>

    </mj-hero>
    <mj-section background-color="#000">
      <mj-column>

        <mj-text color="#fff" align="center">
          <p>It’s been <strong>%%=v(@daysSinceLastVisit)=%% days</strong> since your last visit. We know life gets busy, so here’s a little motivation to get you moving again: </p>
          <h2>%%=v(@membershipDiscount)=%%% off your next class!</h2>
          <p>Your personalized discount code is ready.</p>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-button href="#" inner-padding="12px" padding="0px" border="2px dashed #000" background-color="#fff" font-size="18px" color="#000" font-weight="800">%%=v(@winBackCode)=%%</mj-button>

        <mj-divider border-width="1px" padding-top="30px" border-color="lightgrey" />

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#000" padding-top="0px" padding-bottom="0px">
      <mj-column width="100%" padding-top="0px">

        <mj-text color="#fff" padding-top="0px">
          <h3>Your comeback starts here ❤</h3>
          <p>%%=v(@recommendation_text)=%%</p>
        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="90%" background-color="#000">

        <mj-image border-radius="10px" src="%%=v(@classBanner)=%%"></mj-image>

        <mj-text align="center" padding="0px" line-height="30px" color="#fff">
          <h2>
            <u>%%=v(@classHeadline)=%%</u>
          </h2>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-table color="#fff" align="center" padding-top="0px">
          <tr>
            <td align="right">📅 Every %%=v(@classDay)=%%</td>
            <td align="center" width="30">|</td>
            <td align="left">⏰ %%=v(@classTime)=%%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="right">📍 %%=v(@homeStudio)=%% Studio</td>
            <td align="center" width="30">|</td>
            <td align="left">👟 %%=v(@coachName)=%%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" align="center">⚡ Only %%=v(@spotsLeft)=%% spots left!</td>
          </tr>
        </mj-table>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#000">
      <mj-column>

        <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="lightgrey" />

        <mj-text color="#fff">
          <h3>Look how far you've come. </h3>
          <p> You’ve completed <strong>%%=v(@classCompleted)=%% classes</strong> with us so far. That’s %%=v(@classCompleted)=%% times you showed up, put in the work, and made time for yourself. </p>
          <p>Let's make the next one #%%=v(@nextClassCount)=%%.</p>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-button href="#" inner-padding="15px" padding="0px" font-weight="700" background-color="#fff" font-size="18px" border-radius="0px" color="#000">BOOK MY CLASS</mj-button>

        <mj-text color="#fff">
          <p>See you back in the studio soon! ❤</p>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-divider border-color="lightgrey"></mj-divider>

        <mj-text color="#fff" font-size="12px">
          <p>
            Momentum Fitness Co. respects your right to privacy. To learn more, please review our <a href="#" style="text-decoration:underline; color:#fff">Privacy Policy</a>. This email is an advertisement. If you no longer wish to receive Momentum promotional emails, you can <a href="#" style="text-decoration:underline; color:#fff">unsubscribe</a> at any time.</p>
          <p>Please do not reply to this message. It was sent from a notification-only address that cannot accept incoming emai. Visit <a href="#" style="text-decoration:underline; color:#fff">support.momentumfitness.com</a> for help with our products.</p>
          <p style="text-align:center;">
            © Momentum Fitness Co. All rights reserved
          </p>
        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>